  "details": "Regardless of what the sort dropdown is set to on a user's full \"Uploaded Worlds\" page, the worlds are initially sorted in reverse alphabetical order. Switching to a different sort updates the list correctly, but if you leave the page and come back the list will once again be incorrectly sorted.\n\n1. Open up the profile of a user who has uploaded more than 9 worlds.\n\n2. In the \"Uploaded Worlds\" section, click the + button to go to that user's full list of uploaded worlds.",
